# 263. Ugly Number

**Difficulty:** 🟢 Easy
**Link:** https://leetcode.com/problems/ugly-number/

## Problem
An ugly number is a positive integer whose prime factors are 
limited to 2, 3, and 5.

Given an integer `n`, return `true` if `n` is an ugly number.

